service github: ```md
---
protocol: http
target: https://mcp.github.com/mcp
---

Use this service when the agent needs GitHub access.
```

service linear: ```md
---
protocol: stdio
target: npx -y mcp-remote https://mcp.linear.app/sse
---

Use this service when the agent needs Linear access.
```

service local:
  protocol = http
  target = http://localhost:3000/mcp

  Use this service for local MCP testing.

skill review: ```md
---
source: by3gus/review
description: Review support
---

Use this skill for review workflows.
```

skill rewrite:
  source = by3gus/rewrite
  description = Rewrite support

  Use this skill for rewrite workflows.

psyche reviewer: ```md
Prefer concrete findings and direct language.
```

psyche rigorous:
  Prefer concrete findings.

prompt direct: ```md
Review the current request directly.
```

prompt review: ```md
---
params: path, focus
---

Review {{path}} carefully.
{{focus}}
```

prompt compact:
  params = tone

  Rewrite in a compact {{tone}} tone.
